Joystick Self Test (Step1_Joystick)
Follow each instruction, then press Enter.

................................................
Test 1 of 6: Press the push button and hold it. The LED turns on.
  While holding it, press Enter with the other hand.
  Press Enter: 
  SW: ON  PASS

................................................
Test 2 of 6: Release the push button. The LED turns off.
  Press Enter: 
  SW: OFF  PASS

................................................
Test 3 of 6: Leave the grip at rest. Do not touch the joystick.
  Press Enter: 
CENTER (Test 3, grip at rest)
  A0CO = A0C - 511
  A1CO = A1C - 511
            A0C    A1C    A0CO   A1CO
  *         510    497    -1     -14
  PASS

................................................
Test 4 of 6, first entry, UP: hold the grip at the top edge.
  Keep it there and press Enter with the other hand.
  Press Enter: 
    dir     A0     A1     A0O    A1O
  * UP      0      497    -510   0

................................................
Test 4 of 6, first entry, DOWN: hold the grip at the bottom edge.
  Keep it there and press Enter with the other hand.
  Press Enter: 
    dir     A0     A1     A0O    A1O
  * DOWN    1008   497    498    0

................................................
Test 4 of 6, first entry, LEFT: hold the grip at the left edge.
  Keep it there and press Enter with the other hand.
  Press Enter: 
    dir     A0     A1     A0O    A1O
  * LEFT    468    0      -42    -497

................................................
Test 4 of 6, first entry, RIGHT: hold the grip at the right edge.
  Keep it there and press Enter with the other hand.
  Press Enter: 
    dir     A0     A1     A0O    A1O
  * RIGHT   511    1009   1      512

